WEBVTT

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.650
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
especially now…

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
ima koso

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
forever

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
itsudemo

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.700
Rinse… rinse… rinse… ri-

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.440
Good morning, Futaba Rentarou-kun.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.300
You have to take it, no matter what.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.750
You’re a stubborn one, huh?

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:49.950
To go so far as to intrude on this place early in the morning…

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:56.250
Is the bourgeois trying to exploit the proletariat even during their few enjoyable moments?

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.000
Well then, let’s just leave Soujyu-sama’s child-rearing expenses

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.150
here at this pool for the time being.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.050
Whenever you change your mind…

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.350
I won’t change it, ever!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.700
Call me. My office will treat it as an urgent message.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.450
The number on the card is a direct line to my office.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.100
I told you I don’t need that!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.300
Even if Kimihiko-san doesn’t give his blessing,

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.240
I’ll take responsibility and protect Soujyu.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.350
So in a word, you’re a punk, right?

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:41.000
A man whose own thickness, length, and shapeless condition don’t even measure up…

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.900
will use pure violence to lash out at offenses that come up.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:48.560
Society considers that kind of person a punk.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.850
You’ll take responsibility and protect her?

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.930
How are you going to do that?

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.700
Just keep up your make-believe detective agency?

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:05.540
For ten years? Twenty years? Until something tangible happens?

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.650
Th-That’s…

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.850
The savings accounts?

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.200
The insurance?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.590
The pensions?

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:19.900
All of these…

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.700
for those under President Kimihiko’s protection,

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.900
they can live without lacking anything.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.600
Soujyu-sama could be given happiness which would exceed that of Sara-sama.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:30.950
That empty and foolishly “noble” mindset…

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.700
“I don’t want to hurt anyone; I don’t want to hurt them.”

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.300
But, for whatever reason, because you kept thinking that,

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.750
in the end, both Sara-sama and Soujyu-sama got hurt.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.540
Your indecision in this situation is a precise analogue of your entire life.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:48.200
Still, I’m strongly opposed to it personally,

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:52.400
but it was the president’s idea to entrust Soujyu-sama to you.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:56.500
We would appreciate it if contact would gradually decrease.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.480
Contact me. That’s all.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.980
Autumn is ending, and winter is coming.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.290
When I think about that day a week ago, when the office was burned,

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.280
I got the feeling that something had definitely ended.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.950
Soujyu and I tumbled into old lady Sugisaku’s house and lived as freeloaders.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:40.910
But if you’re not doing anything, time passes very slowly.

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:49.300
What am I going to do from now on?

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:53.190
In the first place,
where will we be from now on?

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.210
Go back to Kimihiko-san’s place.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.320
Ladies! Please think it over one more time!

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.020
The one who needs to think it over again is papa!

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.510
We hate papa!

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.700
Is this okay, old man?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.190
It’s Wadatsumi.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.020
It’s not like I could refuse a partner like him.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.250
Come, come you folks!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:11.150
Did the world know about the collaboration…

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:14.950
formerly knows as John and Yoko’s <i>Milk and Honey</i>?

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.450
Ah, you don’t know!

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:18.450
Well then!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:23.200
This time it’s the dream collaboration of Sugisaku’s Meat and Niko Gen Tofu!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:28.110
I call the Niko Survival Croquette Tofu and Beef!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.350
Healthy and gorgeous, Japanese and western style,

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.650
deliciously appealing and oh so hot.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:37.160
Ah, welcome!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.840
I’m sorry, Michiru-chan.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:51.200
Honestly, the store in front of the station seems to attract more customers,

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.270
and it ruined my business.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:59.050
Taking the eviction compensation and rebuilding my life is a wiser choice.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.250
It’s not about being wise or unwise.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:08.450
It’s not about being wise or unwise.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.270
Stay well.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.170
You too.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:43.560
Huh?

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.700
How silly, how many more shopping malls do they wanna build?

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.900
Yeah, really.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:55.050
We’ll go shopping there, right? Yay!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.490
You’ll buy me the things I want!

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:04.350
AH!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.330
Darling!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.250
Stop it, bear!!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.450
Mikaru!

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.600
Go back to Kimihiko-san’s place.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.250
Say…

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.020
This is a detective office, right?

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.510
I’d like to request a job from you.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.480
Search for me.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.810
Search for me.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:15.630
Why are you so gloomy?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:21.950
Yo!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.150
Yo!

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.190
Translator’s Note: Ika means “squid”. You’ll want to remember it…

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:47.190
Ika!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.200
Ikakakakakakakakakakakakakakaka!

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.850
You were alive?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:12:00.320
So it was you! You were the one who started all those fires…

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.350
Though I’m a squid…

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:09.740
Hey, that’s dangerous!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.300
Ika ika kakakakaka ika!

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.550
Ika!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:41.410
There’s no one on your side…

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:46.380
Ikakakakaka…

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.750
Yes, you’re way too weak.

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:58.670
You’re gone.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.680
Hey there!!!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:21.850
If he were to return from the depths of hell,

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:24.200
what would your noble father do?

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.500
All that’s left of him is you, who is futile and desolate.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.290
You…

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.800
are not needed.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.750
Later!!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.950
Go! Go! Squid fire!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.300
Hold on there!!!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.350
There. Are you all right?

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.990
Hey, hey, are you all right?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.270
Yes… I’m fine.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.600
I want to go to a country somewhere far away.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.500
Yes..?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:38.900
I’m home.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.850
Congratulations!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.000
Congratulations!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.250
Congratulations!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.550
Congratulations!

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:47.900
Congratulations!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.450
Congratulations!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:51.950
W-Wha-what’s the matter?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.200
What are you saying?!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.050
Ah, time passes so fast.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.600
The Futaba Detective Agency,

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.200
since it changed hands to Rentarou,

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:10.470
has reached its two year anniversary as of today.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.100
Congratulations!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.440
Congratulations!

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:18.600
Congratulations on the office!

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:21.850
You guys!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.050
Right now isn’t the right time to do this!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.870
This isn’t supposed to…

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.950
Well, well, well!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.870
It’s okay, drink, drink!

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:48.380
Good, good, good!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.650
By the way, where is Soujyu-chan?

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.300
Ah, that’s right!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.610
Rentarou, what happened to Soujyu-chan?

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.650
What happened, huh?!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.040
Tha-That is…

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.050
You idiot!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.600
You said you wanted to search for Soujyu-chan, didn’t you?

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:32.400
To neglect that until this late, just what on earth were you thinking?!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.850
Well, well, well, listen to Rentarou’s…

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.470
Hey, tell the reason, the reason!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:42.980
This might be the best for Soujyu’s sake.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:56.250
A man like you doesn’t have the right to say that he wants a woman by his side.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:00.500
“Better to end it for the sake of the other person.”

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.590
What are you saying?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:12.720
Your thoughts are exactly as conceited as your father’s. Geez.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.000
What?

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.520
All right, let’s divide the work and search togeth--

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:37.620
Your thoughts are exactly as conceited as your father’s. Geez.

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:13.620
Soujyu!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:54.100
And so, it becomes light on the night of fate, right Rara-chan?

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:58.680
The sun rose to shine on the world once again, Ruru-chan.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:33.940
Soujyu.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.950
I’ve been caught…

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.600
Silly and foolish, the me who was having a good feeling,

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.820
is now starting to get the impression that something is definitely beginning.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.900
No, maybe nothing had ended in the first place.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.680
Then, that night…

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:15.910
Ikakakakakakakaka!!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.900
It’s show time!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.700
Headquarters!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.400
Requesting reinforcements! It’s very urgent!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.850
Kinoshita! Let’s go!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:33.100
Goddamnit! That damn squid again!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.190
Granny, hurry up!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:37.000
Rentarou!

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:40.200
Rentarou!!

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.800
Stop right there!

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.000
Get off there right now!

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.000
I repeat!

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.080
Get off there right now!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:58.840
Ikakakakakakakaka!

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:07.630
And then, on the night of that day,

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:12.310
Futagotamagawa was once again engulfed in flames.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.650
Ikakakakakaka!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:38.230
The days of no return

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:38.230
modoru koto no nai hibi

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:43.030
will leave your heart behind.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:43.030
kokoro wo nokoshite

00:23:53.830 --> 00:24:11.970
If at that time
I had made love to
Sara and Soujyu
would we have
been able to
become happy?

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:18.600
Futakoi

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:18.600
Alternative

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:18.600
Burning Nikotamagawa
